# Wave T37 (Craterlake kit): craterroof — Craterlake City's own
# roof kind. CRATER-WHITE ASHLAR: pale crater-stone blocks
# (#e6e1d5 body, #f4f1ea lit crowns, #b0aa9c seams — the town
# style's own roof register) in offset courses of three, ash
# flecks and a rare dark vent dot in the stone. Coursed ashlar
# is structurally unlike Lastlight's flat parapet slab, Lotus
# Cove's scalloped barrel tile, Steamspring's ridged clay
# barrel and the Gym's banded slab. Worn by the Gym and the
# town's two facade cottages. (NO-SAME-KIT law;
# WAVE-T37-CRATERLAKE-PLAN.md.)
